    "description": "What: Simulated devices SD-S2c (§3.13c D-109). The trainee binds his view to the drone ground station and presses POWER: the station films through its drone (its DeviceView names the drone - the station camera rides it, FollowCameraDriver at its eye); CAM DOWN twice tilts the gimbal 30 degrees down, CAM UP once brings it back to 15. Judge: (1) after POWER the station's DeviceView names the drone (Eyes); (2) CAM DOWN x2: DeviceView.Pitch is -30 degrees (-0.52 rad); CAM UP: -15 degrees (-0.26 rad); (3) before POWER it names nothing. Not judged here: the 3-D camera itself (the headless run has no map camera) - PossessionStationTests.SDS2c_* puts the camera on the drone. Fail: no view, or the gimbal does not move. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh dv-drone-camera"
  },
